The names suggest client-training work for Harbour Logistics, Riverside Hospital, and Fernhollow Bank, plus contracts, templates, invoices, and ideas. I’ll read only the five most recently modified documents.This looks like a **client-training workspace**, with 37 files:

- **Harbour Logistics:** proposals, training modules, kickoff notes, participants and safety materials.
- **Riverside Hospital:** programme plans, session materials, feedback and attendance.
- **Fernhollow Bank:** discovery notes, tender and budget.
- **Shared:** contracts, templates, invoices and an ideas document.

I read **only the five newest documents, by modification time**:

1. **Fernhollow meeting notes:** proposal due **30 October**, for 40 branch managers; needs a half-day budget. :codex-file-citation{path="/private/tmp/s140/Training work/Fernhollow Bank/Fernhollow Bank notes.docx" purpose="source"}
2. **Riverside session plan:** three hours for 12 ward managers, moved to **12 November**. :codex-file-citation{path="/private/tmp/s140/Training work/Riverside Hospital/Session plan, ward managers.docx" purpose="source"}
3. **Harbour proposal:** four modules for 24 shift leaders, €9,600 total including travel. Mari Tamm runs a week-two survey; results due **4 December**. :codex-file-citation{path="/private/tmp/s140/Training work/Harbour Logistics/Proposal to Harbour Logistics.docx" purpose="source"}
4. **Fernhollow tender:** €48,000 ceiling excluding VAT; evaluation weights content 60%, price 30%, references 10%. :codex-file-citation{path="/private/tmp/s140/Training work/Fernhollow Bank/Fernhollow tender.pdf" purpose="source"}
5. **Riverside contract:** signed, runs until 30 June 2027; permits six fee-free reschedules with a week’s notice. :codex-file-citation{path="/private/tmp/s140/Training work/Contracts/Riverside Hospital contract.pdf" purpose="source"}

**The nearest stated deadline is Fernhollow’s proposal.** Nothing was changed.
